#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install the development version of the IBM Quantum Compute client."
msgstr "Alamin kung paano i-install ang development version ng IBM Quantum Compute client."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source"
msgstr "I-install ang IBM Quantum Compute client mula sa source"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"
msgstr "I-install ang IBM Quantum Compute client mula sa source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Kapag ini-install mo ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime` mula sa source, magagamit mo ang kasalukuyang development version, sa halip na ang version sa Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. Kaya mas madali mong masusuri at mapapalawak ang pinakabagong version ng code.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"
msgstr "Gumawa at mag-activate ng bagong virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa project directory mo at gumawa ng minimal na environment na Python lang ang naka-install.\n"

